sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as API / job entry point
    participant Archive as ArchiveItemsCommand
    participant Remind as SendRemindersCommand
    Note over API,Remind: Independent operations: no shared result or success condition
    API->>+Archive: Dispatch through command pipeline
    Archive-->>-API: Result or error
    Note over API: A failure does not suppress the other command
    API->>+Remind: Dispatch through command pipeline
    Remind-->>-API: Result or error
    Note over API: Map each outcome independently; calls need not run in parallel
